        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b> Deltana DSH44, 4\" x 4\" x Square Corners Spring Hinge, Zigzag Holes </b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged complete with One Single Action Spring Door Hinge, Allen Wrench, Adjusting Pin, Locking Pin plus #10 x 1\" Wood Screws and #10-24 x 1/2\" machine screws. Utilizes Zigzag Hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors. Available in 10 different finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe included Allen Wrench Tool is use to adjust spring tension. The Locking Pin holds the Spring in tension after it is set. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese adjustable tension spring hinges allow you to determine how much closing force you apply to the door (how hard/fast the door self closes). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSH44U-specifications.gif?v=1704354580\" width=\"558\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DSH44 Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/4-x-4-stainless-steel-spring-hinge-zigzag-hole-deltana-dsh44u32d\"><b>4\" x 4\" Stainless Steel Spring Hinge</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 4\" x 4\" Spring Hinge :\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Durable Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.097\" (Residential)</li>\r\n<li>Zigzag Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Certified: R19063 UL Listed Door Closer Body 57YM</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #10-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 10</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DSH44.pdf?v=1704262171\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DSH44 Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/spring-hinge-install.pdf?v=1691095378\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana Spring Hinge Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe offer different finishes for this Hinge, but no matter which finish you choose, the parts will still be <b>High Quality Durable Steel.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
